v5.1.0 made the XP button visible in the mirror. It also lowered the volume of the button's Fitness Marshall quotes.<ref name="world" /> Dance Week awards 2 XP per evening, Monday to Friday.<ref name="dw16">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/our-favorite-every-couple-of-months-event-is-back-dance-week-16 Dance Week #16] on ''vrdancing.club'' ({{Date|2026-07-21}}).</ref> Marshallthon participation awards 30 XP.<ref name="m2026">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/marshallthon-2026 Marshallthon 2026] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref> In 2022, 2023, 2024, and 2025, a button appeared at the end of each timeslot.<ref name="m2025">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/marshallthon-2025 Marshallthon 2025] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref> A 2023 Christmas choreography recording awarded 20 XP for the final video with practice.<ref name="xmasxp">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/christmas-choreography Christmas choreography] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref>

Mixieǃ published [https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7593bd1f-6a7f-4cc2-bb74-ff2b47afef90 VRDancing - FX Studio] on {{Date|2023-02-03}}. It has particles, spotlights, and trails.<ref name="fxstudio">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/new-world-fx-studio New World: FX Studio] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref>

VRDancing won Virtual Experience at the 2024 [[Special:MyLanguage/Community:VR Community Awards|VR Community Awards]]. Marshallthon 2024 was a philanthropy finalist. VRDancing was a Virtual Experience finalist in the 2025 awards.<ref name="vrca-past">[https://vrcommunityawards.com/past-winners Past winners] on ''vrcommunityawards.com''.</ref>

== Marshallthon ==

Marshallthon is an annual marathon of every choreography video by The Fitness Marshall. It raises money for [[wikipedia:The Trevor Project|The Trevor Project]] and is streamed on Twitch. Donations can trigger in-world dancefloor effects.<ref name="charity">[https://www.vrdancing.club/charity Charity] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref>

The 2021 event started {{Date|2021-08-21}} {{Time|13:00}} UTC+2 and ran 24 hours. It used invite-plus instances. The 2022 event ran {{Date|2022-09-03}} {{Time|11:00}} to {{Date|2022-09-04}} {{Time|15:00}} UTC+2. It used invite-only instances.<ref name="discord" />

The 2026 event was {{Date|2026-09-05}} {{Time|11:00}} to {{Date|2026-09-06}} {{Time|21:00}} on the American Labor Day weekend. Videos played A to Z across 17 two-hour slots. The VRChat group was required to join.<ref name="m2026" />

