== History ==

The world was created on {{Date|2021-02-09}}.<ref name="listing" /> v5.0.0 shipped on {{Date|2025-02-07}}.<ref name="home" /> v5.4.0 disabled the upstairs intercom on {{Date|2025-08-22}}. The latest published changelog is v5.9.0 on {{Date|2025-12-04}}.<ref name="world" />

Chatmans retired as admin on {{Date|2026-01-04}}.<ref name="chatmans">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/chatmans-is-retiring-from-admin-of-vrdancing Chatmans is retiring from admin of VRDancing] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref> CalliePepper became an admin on {{Date|2026-01-08}}.<ref name="callie">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/new-admin-calliepepper New admin CalliePepper] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref> VRDancing marked five years in January 2026.<ref name="five">[https://www.vrdancing.club/announcements/5-years-of-vrdancing 5 years of VRDancing] on ''vrdancing.club''.</ref>

